     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi all, <div><br></div><div>I am new to using N-mixture models using the unmarked package. I am trying to estimate abundance and detection probabilities for bird species surveyed across three years at 35 different point count stations within two treatments. In each year, I conducted 5 visits to each point count station. I just looked at Western Meadowlark abundance and detection probability, but both seemed abnormally low. I am using the pcount function to fit a model. My encounter data (below code) includes Visits 1-5=2015, Visits 6-10=2016, Visits 11-15=2017, but does not have the site column because it is set up as the &quot;y&quot; data frame for unmarkedFramePCount. I saw a previous post someone had on this topic, but it didn&#39;t seem to apply to my data. The code I used follows:</div><div><br></div><div><div>WEMEy&lt;-read.csv(&quot;yWEME.csv&quot;)</div><div><br></div><div>SiteCovs&lt;-read.csv(&quot;SiteCovs.csv&quot;)</div><div><br></div><div>Obs&lt;-read.csv(&quot;Obs.csv&quot;)</div><div><br></div><div>Wind&lt;-read.csv(&quot;Wind.csv&quot;)</div><div><br></div><div>Cloud&lt;-read.csv(&quot;Cloud.csv&quot;)</div><div><br></div><div>Rain&lt;-read.csv(&quot;Rain.csv&quot;)</div><div><br></div><div>VegHt&lt;-read.csv(&quot;VegHt.csv&quot;)</div><div><br></div><div>Obs.covs&lt;-list(Obs,Wind,Cloud,Rain,VegHt)</div><div>names(Obs.covs) &lt;- c(&quot;Obs&quot;, &quot;Wind&quot;, &quot;Cloud&quot;,&quot;Rain&quot;,&quot;VegHt&quot;)</div><div><br></div><div>WEME1&lt;-unmarkedFramePCount(WEMEy,siteCovs=SiteCovs,obsCovs=Obs.covs)</div><div><br></div><div>fm.WEMENull&lt;-pcount(~1~1,WEME1,K=50)</div><div>fm.WEMENull</div><div>plogis(coef(fm.WEMENull, type=&quot;det&quot;))</div></div><div><br></div><div>Result:  </div><div>p(Int) </div><div>0.04522228 </div><div><br></div><div>I have run this in program Distance and have gotten much higher estimates for detection (around .70) for this species. Thus, I am wondering why my detection probability here is so low. Thanks so much for any insight!</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"960\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:720pt\">\r\n <colgroup><col width=\"64\" span=\"15\" style=\"width:48pt\">\r\n </colgroup><tbody><tr height=\"20\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"20\" width=\"64\" style=\"height:15.0pt;width:48pt\">        Visit1</td>\r\n  <td width=\"64\" style=\"width:48pt\">        Visit2</td>\r\n  <td width=\"64\" style=\"width:48pt\">        Visit3</td>\r\n  <td width=\"64\" style=\"width:48pt\">        Visit4</td>\r\n  <td width=\"64\" style=\"width:48pt\">      Visit5  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"64\" style=\"width:48pt\">       Visit6</td>\r\n  <td width=\"64\" style=\"width:48pt\">        Visit7</td>\r\n  <td width=\"64\" style=\"width:48pt\">        Visit8</td>\r\n  <td width=\"64\" style=\"width:48pt\">        Visit9</td>\r\n  <td width=\"64\" style=\"width:48pt\">      Visit10</td>\r\n  <td width=\"64\" style=\"width:48pt\">      Visit11</td>\r\n  <td width=\"64\" style=\"width:48pt\">      Visit12</td>\r\n  <td width=\"64\" style=\"width:48pt\">      Visit13</td>\r\n  <td width=\"64\" style=\"width:48pt\">      Visit14</td>\r\n  <td width=\"64\" style=\"width:48pt\">      Visit15</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"20\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"20\" align=\"right\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">3</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">3</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">3</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">1</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">2</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">0</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">2</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">2</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">2</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">0</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">1</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">3</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">3</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">1</td>\r\n  <td align=\"right\">2</td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr height=\"20\" style=\"height:15.0pt\">\r\n  <td height=\"20\" align=\"right\" style=\"height:15.0pt\"